.DS_Store
node_modules
www

# Local test media (e.g. sample clips for the Frame trimmer) — never deploy these
*.MOV
*.mov

# Design and store sources — the material a shipped asset was MADE from, which
# is not the same thing as the asset. Neither is loaded by the app, and this
# repo is also the web server: anything here is publicly downloadable at
# triaonline.com. The screenshot photos are licensed stock plus one personal
# photo, and they're 14MB, which git would carry in every clone forever.
Tria Marketing images/
*.af

# Apple's Sign in with Apple key. Not a build artifact and not a preference: this
# repo IS the web server, so a committed .p8 is downloadable from triaonline.com
# by anyone who guesses the filename, and it signs the token that vouches for
# every Apple sign-in. It also downloads exactly once from the portal, so the
# instinct to "keep it somewhere safe" points straight at the repo. It belongs
# in Downloads, or a password manager, and nowhere in here. See apple-secret.mjs
# and supabase/OAUTH-SETUP.md.
*.p8

# Xcode / Capacitor build artifacts (the ios/App project itself is checked in)
ios/App/App/public
ios/DerivedData
ios/App/build
**/xcuserdata
